# Spine transfer (later classic games): up the lab spine's south face at 7.5 m/s into vert air, ; (revert) in
# the air carries the skater over the ridge: "Spine Transfer" (250), down the north face forward,
# a clean landing (0.05 m/s into the wall), rolling away north.
park lab
spawn lab_spine_south
cmd 6 speed 7.5
tap revert 160
run 400
expect event spineTransfer{points=250} within 160..162
expect event land{quality=clean,fakie=false} within 270..290
expect skater.vel.y > 3 at 320
expect event comboLanded{name=Spine Transfer,points=250} within 280..310
expect no event bail
